      "sourceTextSha256": "527aa67311588a930eef7ac1140459af02d99a70d976154590faff544a547fc8",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-a769ac8379f2d25c8c252a41",
        "model": "GPT-6"
      },
      "text": "Welcome to Colombia. A guide will meet you when you arrive at Bogotá Airport, and you'll transfer to your hotel and check in.\n\nDepending on when you land, you can spend the rest of the day at leisure. Take time to rest after your flight or head out for a walk around the city.\n\nBogotá sits high in the Andes and feels different on arrival from Colombia's coastal cities. It's cooler here, mountains rise above the city, and historic quarters sit alongside modern neighbourhoods."
    },
